From e61daeae655f0d107b24d6253ee084c3db49da68 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MT6797 compile experiment <nobody@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] lib: compile MT6797 HIF protocol with an ordered MMIO
 boundary

Compile the original bounded PIO, INIT and ordinary-section code
against real Linux types and MMIO accessors. No registration,
initcall, mapping acquisition or runtime caller is provided.

Internal compile experiment only; not an upstream submission.
The synthetic author is non-certifying; no DCO is asserted.
Assisted-by: LLM
